# Un-ignore data assets that a global gitignore may exclude by extension.
# paper_data/ is committed data; track it regardless of extension.
!*.csv
!*.npz
!beta_bernoulli/model.pt

# Figures are regenerable from the data files; keep them out of the repo.
*.png
*.pdf

# Except the rebuttal-period figures: their per-rollout inputs were not kept,
# so these files are the only record of how they looked.
!rebuttal_diagnostics/**/*.png
!rebuttal_diagnostics/**/*.pdf
